              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Quantity is always in units. A multipack shows its packs beneath, such as “10 packs, 2 units each”, from the product’s Units per pack, never from its title. Supplier SKU has its own column. Add product hides products with nothing left to pack.",
