              "fill": "$rd-fg-muted",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Duplicate copies the carton row under the next letter and validates the added quantities. Delete removes the row and returns its products to the unpacked quantities. Carton IDs follow the supplier packing list: a letter per configuration, numbered within it (A1–A10, B1–B6).",
