              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Import cartons opens the shipment-level spreadsheet flow. Download the template, upload a file, validate its structure, and review cartons before adding them or replacing existing packing. Carton product search remains scoped to the selected carton.",
