              "content": "06.05 with Products open. Products opens and closes from its header line, like Cartons and Pallets, and starts closed while packing. Each product shows its name and variation, supplier SKU, packed count and price per unit; the buyer’s SKU stays on the purchase order. A fully packed product shows a green check, otherwise what’s left. The … menu downloads the label types its packing details ask for, and Download all appears only when two or more can print. Choking hazard labels come from the buyer. Below 32rem each product stacks into three columns.",
