        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "UiZ8n",
          "x": 2512,
          "y": 6834,
          "name": "Board title / 06.10 B",
          "fill": "$rd-fg",
          "content": "06.10 B / Supplier / Pallets with their cartons",
          "fontFamily": "$rd-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "SRm0p",
          "x": 1560,
          "y": 7740,
          "name": "06.10 B1 / Supplier / Choose cartons for a pallet",
          "context": "Opened from Choose cartons on a pallet card. Lists every carton in the shipment, grouped as the Cartons section groups them; a group expands to single cartons. Checked rows are this pallet's cartons. A carton on another pallet shows that pallet and can be chosen: saving moves it here. Search matches carton IDs, supplier SKUs and product names. The footer counts the chosen cartons and their weight. Save applies the choice; Cancel keeps the pallet as it was. Modal traps focus, closes with Escape and returns focus to Choose cartons. Shown: Cartons 7–12 split, 7–9 on this pallet and 10–12 on Pallet 3, with Carton 13 just checked. A group expands to single cartons; when only some are chosen its box shows a dash. Shift-click selects a run of cartons. Checking a carton on another pallet moves it here, and its row says “Moves from Pallet 3”. The pallet card then shows chips 7–9 and 13.",
          "width": 672,
