              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Design note, not part of the dialog. Shown: Cartons 7–12 split, 7–9 on this pallet and 10–12 on Pallet 3, with Carton 13 just checked. A group expands to single cartons; when only some are chosen its box shows a dash. Shift-click selects a run of cartons. Checking a carton on another pallet moves it here, and its row says “Moves from Pallet 3”. The pallet card then shows chips 7–9 and 13.",
