          "context": "Phone layout of the Pallets section (06.10 B), below the cartons when Packed on pallets is checked. Header actions keep only icons: import and add pallet. Each pallet card follows the phone carton card: a gray header with the title and actions, 44px inputs with labels below; dimensions on one row, gross weight and stackability on the next. Below, the pallet's carton chips wrap, and Choose cartons is a full-width button that opens the carton chooser as a full-height sheet. The warning for cartons left off every pallet sits under the last card.",
