          "y": 11863,
          "name": "06.29 / Packing / Carton and pallet tables, phone",
          "context": "06.27 (v6) on a phone. Each carton row becomes a card: its IDs and contents summary head the card beside the chevron, issue count and menu; its fields stack under labels (Count and Weight side by side, Dimensions full width). Open cards show their products in the light band, one block each with its own Supplier SKU and Quantity labels, since there are no columns to line up with; Add product closes the band. Pallets follow the same pattern, with their cartons as tags under Choose cartons. Import and Add sit beside each section title as icon buttons. Pallets open and close like cartons: a closed pallet shows how many cartons and units it holds, and opening it shows its cartons.",
