          "y": 11863,
          "name": "06.30 / Packing / Carton and pallet tables, phone read-only",
          "context": "06.28 (v6 read-only) on a phone, from 06.29. Fields show their values as text under their labels; no inputs, menus, add, import, remove or choose actions, and no warnings. Cards still open to show products (C1 is open). A pallet lists its cartons as text. Every unit is packed and every carton is on a pallet. Pallets open and close like cartons: a closed pallet shows how many cartons and units it holds, and opening it shows its cartons. Each carton's Count, Dimensions and Weight share one line, and so do each pallet's Dimensions, Weight and Stacking.",
