          "x": 2014,
          "y": 210,
          "name": "07.04 / Packing / Import cartons, review mobile",
          "context": "Carton import design. Validate file structure before review: supported XLSX or CSV, readable nonempty Cartons sheet, required unique headers. Template columns: Carton ID, Carton count, SKU, Quantity per carton, Length (cm), Width (cm), Height (cm), Weight (kg). One row per carton and product. Repeated carton IDs have consistent counts and measurements. Quantity counts sellable packs; pack sizes come from accepted PO products. Downloaded XLSX includes a Products reference sheet. Invalid template blocks Review import and lists missing or conflicting headers. Review performs SKU matching, numeric validation, shipment allocation, and current FBA/AWD checks before enabling import. Errors are shown inline; no error download. Do not import partial files. Add cartons is the initial choice; Replace packing is shown selected as a deliberate review state. Close/Back keeps current packing. Final import applies atomically, closes dialog, refreshes carton totals, with the imported values displayed. If applying fails, show an inline error and Close, with no Retry button. Success has no toast or additional screen. Modal traps focus, closes with Escape, and returns focus to Import cartons; errors are announced. On mobile, long review content scrolls with actions reachable.",
