          "name": "10.13 / Buyer / Upload carrier labels, label preview",
          "context": "A label’s thumbnail opens it at full size, here ups-b.pdf page 4 from Not placed in 10.12. It’s a UPS label bought in Shopify: a picture with no text, so its tracking number was read from its barcode, and Carrier comes from the tracking number. Opening the preview reads the picture’s text, which gives the weight and size it prints and lies invisibly over the picture to select and copy (10.13 states show it reading). Carton places it without dragging, for keyboard users and phones; choosing a carton that has a label sends that one back to Not placed. The arrows step through the labels waiting in Not placed. All labels goes back to the lists.",
