          "x": 40,
          "y": 1489,
          "name": "Row note / Timeline",
          "fill": "#71717A",
          "content": "Newest first, grouped by day, with one line through every stop from the comment box down. A comment shows its author, and the company when it's another one. A revision opens to list its lines.",
